<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Barattarna</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 1500 BCE</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century-bce">16th century BCE</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Barattarna was an early king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mitanni">Mitanni</a> around c. 1500 BCE. Under his rule Mitanni extended its power over northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/syria">Syria</a> and neighbouring states. He is regarded as one of the founders of the Mitanni Empire as a regional power.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/barattarna.jpg" alt="Barattarna" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Near_East_topographic_map-blank.svg: Sémhur derivative work: Zunkir (talk) · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Carte_du_Mitanni.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
